<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African gold output rises in June.</title>
<headline>S.African gold output rises in June.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold output rose in June to 41.67 tonnes from May's 39.68 tonnes, Chamber of Mines figures show.</p>
</text>
